OL,3,GNEWSAEV charging trial for homes
OL,4,Awithout driveways
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial aimed at helping people without
OL,7,Fdriveways charge electric vehicles at
OL,8,Fhome could be rolled out in Kirklees.
OL,10,FThe proposed 12-month pilot would see
OL,11,Fspecial channels installed beneath
OL,12,Fpavements, allowing charging cables to
OL,13,Frun safely between homes and vehicles
OL,14,Fparked on the street.
OL,16,FKirklees Council is expected to receive
OL,17,Fup to #330,000 towards the scheme
OL,18,Fthrough funding secured by the West
OL,19,FYorkshire Combined Authority (WYCA).
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
