OL,3,GNEWSAEV charging trial for homes
OL,4,Awithout driveways
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor John Hardie said the plans
OL,7,Fwould provide a "safe and practical
OL,8,Fcharging solution" for residents
OL,9,Fwithout access to off-street parking.
OL,10,FIf approved the trial is expected to
OL,11,Fbegin later this year.
